      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Crown Copyright © 2017. Published by Elsevier B.V. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "A high-quality custom database of MALDI-TOF mass spectral profiles was developed with the goal of improving clinical diagnostic identification of high-consequence bacterial pathogens. A biomarker discovery method is presented for identifying and evaluating MALDI-TOF MS spectra to potentially differentiate biothreat bacteria from less-pathogenic near-neighbour species."
      },
